  "description": "*“Should I stop? There’s already a mess inside you.”*\n\nWon-Young, who suspected frigidity, goes to see his friend Yeon-Woo for treatment.\n\n *“No! That’s not it. It hurts. It really hurts.”\n“Yeah.”\n“Don’t take it out. Keep going.”*\n\nThe thrilling sensation that comes every time the black nitrile gloves pass between her legs. Won-Young can’t hold back a moan at the leaking love juice. \n\n*“Right now, I think I’m going to go. So do something about it.”*\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Metatoon's Deotitong Danpyeonseon (더티톡 단편선) Collection.*",
